  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">Bihar Police BPSSC ASI (Operation) Pre Result 2026</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-08-12T16:27:04+05:30\">August 12, 2026</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">4:27 pm</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://bpssc.bihar.gov.in/\">Bihar Police Subordinate Services Commission BPSSC</a>,</strong> has released the <strong>Pre</strong> <strong>Result</strong>\u00a0on its <strong>official website</strong>\u00a0for the recruitment of\u00a0<strong>Bihar Police BPSSC ASI (Operation) Post. </strong>The exam was conducted from <strong>22 July 2026.</strong> The\u00a0BPSSC application process\u00a0started on\u00a0<strong>04 February 2026,</strong> and candidates were able to submit their form until\u00a0<strong>04 March 2026.</strong> Candidates can Download their <strong>Result </strong>using their<strong> Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>\u00a0by logging into the\u00a0portal. The direct link\u00a0is provided below.\u00a0<strong>(<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Advt.No. 04/2026</span>)</strong></span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .social-button {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: white;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .whatsapp {\n            background-color: #25D366;\n        }\n        .whatsapp:hover {\n            background-color: #1EBE57;\n        }\n        .telegram {\n            background-color: #0088cc;\n        }\n        .telegram:hover {\n            background-color: #0078b8;\n        }\n        .icon {\n            margin-right: 8px;\n        }\n    </style></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a class=\"apply-button\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n</div>\n<style>\n        /* Button Style */\n        .apply-button {\n            text-align:center;\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 15px 30px;\n            font-size: 18px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: red;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-align: center;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.2s ease;\n        }\n\n    \n    </style>\n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"> Telegram </a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">Bihar Police BPSSC ASI (Operation) Pre Result 2026 \u2013 Out</h2>\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">Bihar Police BPSSC ASI (Operation) Examination 2026 : Short Details</h3>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/bihar-police-bpssc-asi-operation-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date : <strong>04 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Last Date : <strong>04 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date For Fee Payment : <strong>04 March</strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>\u00a02026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Date : </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">22 July 2026</span></strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card :\u00a0<strong>07 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card (With Exam Center) : <strong>17 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Declared Date :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong> 12 August 2026 Available Now</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <b>Bihar BPSSC </b>official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>All</strong> <strong>Category</strong> <strong>Candidates</strong> : <strong>\u20b9 100/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">Bihar Police BPSSC ASI (Operation) Notification 2026 : Age Limits As On 01 August 2025</h5>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age :\u00a0<strong>21 Years. (All Category)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age :\u00a0<strong>37 Years.( General/ EWS Male)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age :\u00a0<strong>40 Years. (General / EWS Female)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age :\u00a0<strong>40 Years.( BC/ EBC Male &amp; Female)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age :\u00a0<strong>42 Years. (SC / ST Male &amp; Female)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><b>Bihar BPSSC </b>provides age relaxation for the <strong>Police ASI (Operation) </strong>position as per their regulations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb